        "## Restructuration Monolithique SHA-512\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Re-implement the ԑԒԂԕԁ_Ԓԁ_ԩԤԢԉ class to use a SHA-512 based deterministic seed for its multi-layered rotation logic.\n"
      ]
